============================================================
Hisabji User Authentication এবং User Flow
============================================================

এই document বর্তমান server implementation অনুযায়ী তৈরি করা হয়েছে।

Base URL:
http://localhost:8080

API Base URL:
http://localhost:8080/api/v1


১. প্রয়োজনীয় service চালু করা
============================================================

PostgreSQL database:

Database name: hisabji
Host: localhost
Port: 5432

Redis Docker container চালু করা:

docker start hisabji-redis

Redis connection test:

docker exec hisabji-redis redis-cli PING

Expected output:

PONG

যদি container আগে তৈরি না করা থাকে:

docker run -d --name hisabji-redis --restart unless-stopped -p 6379:6379 -v hisabji-redis-data:/data redis:7-alpine redis-server --appendonly yes


২. Environment configuration
============================================================

.env ফাইলে:

APP_ENV=development
PORT=8080
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:YOUR_PASSWORD@localhost:5432/hisabji
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
JWT_SECRET=your-long-random-jwt-secret
OTP_SECRET=your-long-random-otp-secret

গুরুত্বপূর্ণ:

- development mode-এ register response-এর মধ্যে OTP দেখা যাবে।
- production mode-এ OTP response-এ ফেরত যাবে না। Production-এ SMS provider যুক্ত করতে হবে।
- JWT_SECRET production-এ অবশ্যই পরিবর্তন করতে হবে।


৩. Server চালু করা
============================================================

go run ./cmd/api

Server চালু হলে:

http://localhost:8080/

Root response:

{
	"success": true,
	"message": "Hisabji server is running",
	"service": "Hisabji API",
	"env": "development"
}

Database এবং Redis health check:

GET http://localhost:8080/health


৪. Registration flow
============================================================

ধাপ ১: User registration API hit করুন

POST /api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register ^
	-H "Content-Type: application/json" ^
	-d "{\"name\":\"Rasel Khan\",\"phone\":\"01700000000\",\"email\":\"rasel@example.com\",\"username\":\"raselkhan\",\"password\":\"12345678\"}"

Server-এর ভিতরে কাজের sequence:

১. Password bcrypt দিয়ে hash হয়।
২. User record PostgreSQL-এর users table-এ insert হয়।
৩. একটি ৬ digit OTP তৈরি হয়।
৪. OTP-এর raw value নয়, SHA-256 hash PostgreSQL-এর phone_otps table-এ save হয়।
৫. development mode হলে raw OTP response-এ ফেরত যায়।
৬. Redis-এ register endpoint-এর IP rate-limit counter update হয়।

Development response-এর উদাহরণ:

{
	"message": "verification OTP sent",
	"otp": "123456",
	"user": {
		"phone": "01700000000",
		"username": "raselkhan"
	}
}

PostgreSQL tables:

users       = user profile এবং password hash
phone_otps  = OTP hash, expiry, consumed status


৫. OTP verification flow
============================================================

POST /api/v1/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/verify-otp ^
	-H "Content-Type: application/json" ^
	-d "{\"phone\":\"01700000000\",\"otp\":\"123456\"}"

Server-এর ভিতরে:

১. Request-এর OTP hash করা হয়।
২. PostgreSQL phone_otps table-এ phone, hash, expiry এবং consumed_at check হয়।
৩. OTP valid হলে phone_otps.consumed_at update হয়।
৪. users.phone_verified = true হয়।
৫. OTP দ্বিতীয়বার ব্যবহার করা যায় না।
৬. Redis rate-limit counter update হয়।

Success response:

{
	"message": "phone verified"
}

Invalid বা expired OTP:

{
	"error": "invalid or expired OTP"
}


৬. Login flow এবং JWT token
============================================================

Phone, email অথবা username দিয়ে login করা যায়।

POST /api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login ^
	-H "Content-Type: application/json" ^
	-d "{\"identifier\":\"raselkhan\",\"password\":\"12345678\"}"

Server-এর ভিতরে:

১. PostgreSQL users table থেকে identifier দিয়ে user খোঁজা হয়।
২. Password hash-এর সঙ্গে bcrypt comparison হয়।
৩. ভুল password হলে login_attempts table-এ record insert হয়।
৪. পাঁচটি failed attempt হলে ৬ ঘণ্টার lock হয়।
৫. সঠিক password হলে login_attempts record delete হয়।
৬. phone_verified false হলে login বন্ধ থাকে।
৭. verification সফল হলে JWT token তৈরি হয়।
৮. Redis login এবং global IP rate-limit counter update হয়।

Success response:

{
	"user": { "id": "...", "phone": "01700000000" },
	"token": "eyJ..."
}

পরবর্তী protected request-এ header দিতে হবে:

Authorization: Bearer eyJ...

ভুল password-এর ৫ বার পর response:

{
	"error": "too many failed attempts; try again after 6 hours"
}


৭. Current user endpoints
============================================================

বর্তমানে authentication-এর পর এই endpointগুলো available:

PUT /api/v1/users/me
PUT /api/v1/users/me/username
DELETE /api/v1/users/me

প্রতিটি request-এ JWT header প্রয়োজন।

Profile update:

curl -X PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me ^
	-H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" ^
	-H "Content-Type: application/json" ^
	-d "{\"name\":\"Rasel Ahmed\",\"email\":\"new@example.com\",\"user_image_path\":\"/uploads/rasel.png\"}"

Username setup/update:

curl -X PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me/username ^
	-H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" ^
	-H "Content-Type: application/json" ^
	-d "{\"username\":\"rasel_new\"}"

Account delete:

curl -X DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me ^
	-H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN"

বর্তমান code-এ GET /api/v1/users/me endpoint এখনো নেই।
User profile পড়ার জন্য এই endpoint পরবর্তী ধাপে implement করতে হবে।


৮. PostgreSQL বনাম Redis data responsibility
============================================================

PostgreSQL হলো permanent source of truth:

users:
- name, phone, email, username
- password_hash
- user_image_path
- phone_verified
- plan এবং user metadata

phone_otps:
- OTP-এর hash
- OTP expiry
- consumed_at

login_attempts:
- ভুল password attempt
- ৬ ঘণ্টার failed-login lock হিসাব

Redis-এ শুধু temporary distributed rate-limit counter থাকে:

rl:global:<ip>
rl:auth:register:<ip>
rl:auth:login:<ip>
rl:auth:verify-otp:<ip>
rl:user:update:<ip>
rl:user:username:<ip>
rl:user:delete:<ip>

Redis value সাধারণত request count এবং TTL:

GET rl:auth:login:127.0.0.1
TTL rl:auth:login:127.0.0.1

Redis-এ রাখা হয় না:

- password
- raw OTP
- JWT token
- user profile


৯. Redis keys দেখা এবং reset করা
============================================================

Redis shell খুলুন:

docker exec -it hisabji-redis redis-cli

সব rate-limit key দেখুন:

SCAN 0 MATCH rl:* COUNT 100

একটি key-এর count দেখুন:

GET rl:auth:login:127.0.0.1

Key-এর অবশিষ্ট TTL দেখুন:

TTL rl:auth:login:127.0.0.1

একটি rate-limit key reset:

DEL rl:auth:login:127.0.0.1

সব Redis rate-limit key reset:

EVAL "for _,k in ipairs(redis.call('keys','rl:*')) do redis.call('del',k) end return 1" 0

সতর্কতা: production-এ নির্দিষ্ট key ছাড়া সব key delete করবেন না।


১০. PostgreSQL lock দেখা এবং reset করা
============================================================

pgAdmin Query Tool-এ:

SELECT identifier, COUNT(*) AS failed_attempts,
			 MIN(created_at) AS first_attempt,
			 MAX(created_at) AS last_attempt
FROM login_attempts
WHERE created_at > NOW() - INTERVAL '6 hours'
GROUP BY identifier
ORDER BY last_attempt DESC;

একজন user-এর failed-login lock reset:

DELETE FROM login_attempts
WHERE identifier = 'raselkhan';

সব failed-login record reset:

TRUNCATE TABLE login_attempts;


১১. End-to-end সংক্ষিপ্ত flow
============================================================

১. PostgreSQL এবং Redis চালু করুন।
২. go run ./cmd/api চালান।
৩. POST /api/v1/auth/register hit করুন।
৪. Development response থেকে OTP নিন।
৫. POST /api/v1/auth/verify-otp hit করুন।
৬. POST /api/v1/auth/login hit করুন।
৭. Response থেকে JWT token নিন।
৮. Bearer token দিয়ে user update বা username setup করুন।
৯. Redis-এ rl:* keys এবং PostgreSQL-এ users/phone_otps/login_attempts দেখুন।

